<!--
    FTMS Treadmill data field.
    minSdkVersion 3.2.0: Bluetooth (3.1) + Activity.getCurrentWorkoutStep() (3.2).
    Products: every Garmin watch whose firmware offers both Toybox.BluetoothLowEnergy and
    Activity.getCurrentWorkoutStep() (per the "Supported Devices" lists in Garmin's API docs,
    Nov 2026) and gives data fields at least 64 KB of memory. Shared ids cover the sister models
    (tactix, quatix, Enduro 2, D2 Mach 1 Pro, D2 Air X15). Not included: watches with 32 KB for
    data fields (e.g. fenix 6 / 6S, Forerunner 55 / 245, Instinct 2, Venu, vivoactive 4): the
    field does not fit. Edge bike computers have the APIs but no treadmill activity.
-->
